{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねえ見て見て！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1205200/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レゴで作ってみた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暇なんですね、\nってツッコミいらないです。\n乃木坂想いって言ってください、はい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は乃木どこの収録でした(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、帰りの電車でなんだか\nはなまるうどんの期間限定のサラダうどんが\n食べたくなって\n食べてます←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めて\n昨日は来てくださってありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1205200/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田は日焼け止めちゃんと塗ったはずなのに\n紫外線のアレルギー的なやつのせいで\n腕とか首元とかが肌荒れしてます\nもっと気をつけます(´；ω；｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん日焼けとか大丈夫でしたか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう握手会のレポの件ね、\n運営ブログにあるし\n中田は書かない方がいいかしら\nと思う今日この頃..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねえ、どう思う？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1205200/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てんとう虫のケーキは何の味？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nさくらんぼ！\nあとバニラのムースとか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこで売ってる？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nFUNsってケーキ屋さんです＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋名物あんかけスパ食べたことある？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n全国キャラバンの名古屋に\n行ったときに食べた！\n今回は名古屋名物食べてないです＞＜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"AKB48さんの『ヒグラシノコイ』のサビ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーたーしーが\nなーかだかな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"に聞こえるとかデフォ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや\n絶対中田への私信でしょ｀・ω・´←ぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}